file tools/fixtures/f/fleet_roster_scan.sh the one parse; a question about a seat the table does not hold exits 2 and prints nothing
file tools/fixtures/f/fleet_roster_control.sh seventeen behaviors on real files and a throwaway pen, every refusal shown from both sides
file tools/f/fleet_roster_witness.rish the roster guard, rostered the lap it was written
file tools/l/fleet-loop.sh four seat tables become four lookups; the elder remap moves into the roster's own rows
file tools/f/fleet_rearm.sh nine report_seat rows become one loop over the reader, closing the six-versus-nine disagreement by construction
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- %374 built and %409 closed; the charter's step 4, nine launch printers collapsing to one that reads the roster, is the next lap and it carries the molt breach of the modality filenames
